	"FriendlyName": "LinkPLCByMQTT",
	"Description": "MQTT client minimal-primitive plugin based on libmosquitto 2.1.2 (EPL-2.0 OR EDL-1.0, used under EDL-1.0). Static blocking multi-connection manager (FLinkPLCByMQTTManager) plus a Blueprint function library (ULinkPLCByMQTTBPLibrary): connect, publish, subscribe, unsubscribe, manual network-loop pump and an inbound message queue. No async, no threads, no polling, no UI — async strategy is left to the caller.",
